 debian/changelog                |  9 +++++++++
 debian/libdisplay-info3.symbols | 10 +++++-----
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 46ba477..c526bc8 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+libdisplay-info (0.3.0-1ubuntu1~hdr6) stonking; urgency=medium
+
+  * Mark symbols introduced between private downstream revisions with the
+    documented terminal-tilde minimum versions (hdr4~ and hdr5~).
+  * Preserve unchanged production source, tests and ABI; repackage qualified
+    objects and retain prior hdr5 artifacts and receipts.
+
+ -- Paul Junod <donujp@gmail.com>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 03:01:29 -0400
+
 libdisplay-info (0.3.0-1ubuntu1~hdr5) stonking; urgency=medium
 
   * Add structured extension parsing/framing failure status without changing
